# Recover the Farmland (Q327), from Leikan: a level 25 character accepts at Leikan and carries
# his letter to Piotur, whose accept page then starts nothing; five Turek archers and five shamans give five dogtags, five medallions and
# ten clay urn fragments (every roll pinned to succeed, so each relic piece is a clay urn
# fragment); Piotur pays 40 a dogtag, 50 a medallion and 619 more for ten or more, and Leikan moves
# the quest on; Asha restores two ancient clay urns from the fragments and, without brass pieces,
# leaves her page as it is; Iris has no fragment left to buy; Nestle trades one urn for D-grade
# soulshots and has nothing for a missing tiara; Iris buys the other urn for experience, then has
# nothing; then the player quits at Piotur; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of
# this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q327_recover_the_farmland.golden
character Farmer 25
random always 0
script quest.Q327_RecoverTheFarmland
item 5012 1846 1847 1848 1849 1850 1851 1852 1853 1854 1855 1463 2510 1061 734 735 736 737
page default/30597.htm
page guard/30382.htm
